# IDE / Editor
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
# Ignore Visual Studio folders everywhere
**/.vs/ 
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user

# Node / npm
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log

# Build / output
**/bin
**/obj

# Docker / k8s
**/.dockerignore
**/azds.yaml
**/charts

# Environment / Secrets
**/.env
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml

# Database / Generated files
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Keep Git tracked files
!.gitignore

# Optional: ignore local Dockerfiles but not committed ones
# **/Dockerfile*
# **/docker-compose*

# Track important project files
!README.md
!LICENSE
